This is a placeholder for the Windows icon file.

To use the ScaleHouse Connector, you need to:
1. Create a 256x256 pixel .ico file with your ScaleHouse logo
2. Replace this file with the actual icon.ico file

You can create .ico files using:
- Online tools like favicon.io or icoconvert.com
- Image editing software like GIMP or Photoshop
- Windows built-in icon editor

The icon will be displayed in:
- System tray
- Application window
- MSI installer
- Installed application shortcuts
